Demo for building Apps for QtMoko2.

This directory should receive all configs needed for
packaging this for the Debian Source packages and
build system.

/src/ contains the sources and Qt Makefile.

For testing:
* [ -x /usr/bin/qmake ] || apt-get install qt-sdk
* [ -x /usr/bin/qtcreator ] || apt-get install qcreator
* [ -x /usr/bin/git ] || apt-get install git
* git clone http://git.goldelico.com/gta04-qtmoko.git
* cd gta04-qtmoko/qtmoko2/QtHelloWorld
* qmake -project src
* qmake
* make
* run the binary from local directory ./QtHelloWorld
